copy:
  cta: Create account
  intro: Finish a new account with a name and an optional email after the phone number is verified
  title: Almost there
checks:
  - The name is required and the email is optional
  - 'Everything this screen promises works: finish a new account with a name and an optional email after
    the phone number is verified'
```

