## 11. Flows

### FLW-001 - Find a product and place an order

```yaml id=FLW-001 kind=flow
name: Find a product and place an order
primary: true
screens: [SCR-004, SCR-006, SCR-011, SCR-012, SCR-013]
start: SCR-004
end: SCR-013
purpose: The main journey, from the home screen to a placed order.
```

